{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each corner of a rectangular prism is cut off.  Two (of the eight) cuts are shown.  How many edges does the new figure have?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa5dea9ee182b4ce1bfdbb26fb958aa0e14ad235.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(3,0)--(3,3)--(0,3)--cycle); draw((3,0)--(5,2)--(5,5)--(2,5)--(0,3)); draw((3,3)--(5,5)); draw((2,0)--(3,1.8)--(4,1)--cycle,linewidth(1)); draw((2,3)--(4,4)--(3,2)--cycle,linewidth(1)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/e/d6efb90c71d8236a62b54e7de294a8cd0e08903e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 24 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 30 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 36 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 42 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The new figure retains each of the original <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> edges of the prism and gains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> new edges from each cut. Therefore, the new figure has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/c/a4c0a90950e07d1691a907128bf6e8224d20a1be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\cdot 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc93e9d7387cdc6a1582ed920505d3242949f429.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 36\\text{ edges}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME\" title=\"1990 AJHSME\">1990 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=